    "physical_scope": "Three-storey recessed historic teaching block extended on its east, producing a 山-shaped plan with a long northern corridor and three southward projections onto the school court. Its west end faces the former Boulevard de Montigny. The school website dates the institutional rename earlier than the television account that combines it with the 1913 move."
  },
